gin="55.427" end="55.850">the</span> <span begin="55.850" end="56.936">same</span> <span begin="56.936" end="57.250">as</span> <span begin="57.250" end="57.810">I</span> <span begin="57.810" end="58.991">was</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为我已然不是昨日的自己</span></p><p begin="1:00.510" end="1:05.707" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.510" end="1:00.944">As</span> <span begin="1:00.944" end="1:01.413">I</span> <span begin="1:01.413" end="1:02.374">shoul</span><span begin="1:02.374" end="1:02.798">der</span> <span begin="1:02.798" end="1:03.322">the</span> <span begin="1:03.322" end="1:04.245">weight</span> <span begin="1:04.245" end="1:04.686">of</span> <span begin="1:04.686" end="1:05.051">the</span> <span begin="1:05.051" end="1:05.707">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当我肩负起 一个世界的重任</span></p><p begin="1:06.690" end="1:13.123" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.690" end="1:06.905">I</span> <span begin="1:06.905" end="1:07.312">was</span> <span begin="1:07.312" end="1:07.837">set</span><span begin="1:07.837" end="1:08.100">ting</span> <span begin="1:08.100" end="1:08.765">in</span> <span begin="1:08.765" end="1:09.637">stone</span> <span begin="1:10.332" end="1:10.491">un</span><span begin="1:10.491" end="1:10.787">til</span> <span begin="1:10.787" end="1:10.948">I</span> <span begin="1:10.948" end="1:11.473">no</span><span begin="1:11.473" end="1:11.892">ticed</span> <span begin="1:11.892" end="1:12.209">it</span> <span begin="1:12.209" end="1:13.123">right</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我本一成不变 直至我察觉对错</span></p><p begin="1:13.934" end="1:16.801" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.934" end="1:14.101">Do</span> <span begin="1:14.101" end="1:14.504">you</span> <span begin="1:14.504" end="1:15.021">see</span> <span begin="1:15.021" end="1:15.443">how</span> <span begin="1:15.443" end="1:15.898">you&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:15.898" end="1:16.801">grown?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你可见证了 我的成长历程</span></p><p begin="1:17.558" end="1:19.878" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.558" end="1:17.823">Don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:17.823" end="1:18.343">be</span> <span begin="1:18.343" end="1:19.058">sor</span><span begin="1:19.058" end="1:19.273">ry,</span> <span begin="1:19.273" end="1:19.878">then</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不必心怀歉意</span></p><p begin="1:21.272" end="1:24.982" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.272" end="1:21.406">And</span> <span begin="1:21.406" end="1:21.800">I</span> <span begin="1:21.800" end="1:22.349">fall</span> <span begin="1:22.349" end="1:22.778">from</span> <span begin="1:22.778" end="1:23.234">my</span> <span begin="1:23.234" end="1:24.982">bones</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在脱胎换骨之后</span></p><p begin="1:24.982" end="1:28.022" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.982" end="1:25.172">And</span> <span begin="1:25.172" end="1:25.366">now</span> <span begin="1:25.366" end="1:25.614">I</span> <span begin="1:25.614" end="1:26.072">know</span> <span begin="1:26.072" end="1:26.447">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:26.447" end="1:26.919">a</span><span begin="1:26.919" end="1:28.022">live</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">终于明白 我已重获新生</span></p><p begin="1:28.977" end="1:33.455" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.977" end="1:29.241">I</span> <span begin="1:29.241" end="1:29.634">want</span> <span begin="1:29.634" end="1:30.017">you</span> <span begin="1:30.017" end="1:30.433">to</span> <span begin="1:30.433" end="1:32.339">find</span> <span begin="1:32.339" end="1:33.455">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我希望你 也会发现</span></p><p begin="1:36.861" end="1:42.410" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.861" end="1:37.369">And</span> <span begin="1:37.369" end="1:37.848">I</span> <span begin="1:37.848" end="1:39.215">watched</sp